  "payload": {
    "subject": "修复删除接口 404 — URL 改用路径参数",
    "context": "#002",
    "content": "## 问题\n删除按钮调用 `POST /api/Produce/ProductComponents/Delete` 报 404。\n\n## 根因\n前端把 `id` 放在 POST body `{ data: { id: row.id } }`，但后端 `Delete(int id)` 默认从 URL 绑定。项目其他所有 Delete 都是把 id 拼在 URL 路径上。\n\n## 修复\n将 L93 `Http.post(\"/api/Produce/ProductComponents/Delete\", { data: { id: row.id } })` 改为：`Http.post(\"/api/Produce/ProductComponents/Delete/\" + row.id)`",
    "files": [
      "D:/work/cc/caikuangzi.fenluwebproject/trunk/Web/Web/v2/views/productionManage/commonProductionStages/ProductComponents/index.html"
    ],
    "actions": [
      "修改 Delete API 调用方式为 URL 路径参数",
      "验证删除确认流程正常"
    ]
  }
}
